        "uuid": "aff13b42-c34d-488c-bb0e-e4ecff56dc48",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The irregular shape of the lesion, particularly the oval appearance, can also be a sign of malignancy and should not be taken as a definitive marker of benignity.",
