        "uuid": "4db601fe-4d5d-4aa0-b8fb-0d0392a690ae",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion's hyperechoic appearance is not inherently malignant. The echo pattern can vary among benign lesions, and hyperechoic areas are not uncommon in benign structures such as hamartomas and lipomas",
